  <div class="pl-cards">
    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>ArticleRepository.kt — inject Firebase + patch delete() + batch add()</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Extend the post-app-scope constructor with <code>firestore: FirebaseFirestore</code> and <code>firebaseAuth: FirebaseAuth</code> (both already <code>@Singleton</code> in the Hilt graph). In <code>delete()</code> replace the two raw <code>getInstance()</code> calls with the injected handles. In <code>add()</code> hoist the per-datum article transform into a <code>map {}</code>, call <code>articleDao.upsertArticles(articlesToAdd)</code> once, then iterate the original list for associated-data inserts.</p>
