    <details class="pl-card-d">
      <summary>DefaultArticleRepositoryTest.kt — two new assertions: delete() injection + add() bulk upsert</summary>
      <div class="pl-card">
        <p>Wire <code>ArticleRepositoryImpl</code> with <code>@MockK</code> fakes for all constructor params including the two new Firebase handles. Assert that <code>delete()</code> accesses <code>firebaseAuth.currentUser</code> and <code>firestore.collection(...)</code> on the injected mocks (raw <code>getInstance()</code> would throw without a <code>mockkStatic</code> registration). Assert that <code>add()</code> calls <code>upsertArticles</code> exactly once and <code>upsertArticle</code> exactly zero times.</p>
